<title>USA: Protective Life to buy Parliament Dental.</title>
<headline>Protective Life to buy Parliament Dental.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Protective Life Corp said on Friday it agreed to acquire Parliament Dental Plans Inc, a dental health maintenance organization based in Houston, for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Parliament has about 14,000 members in Texas. Protective Life's dental units have more than 400,000 members nationwide.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
